<title>USA: GOLF-LEADING SCORES AT HONDA CLASSIC AFTER FIRST ROUND.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING SCORES AT HONDA CLASSIC AFTER FIRST ROUND.</headline>
<dateline>CORAL SPRINGS, Florida 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores</p>
<p>from the $1.5 million Honda Classic after the first round at</p>
<p>the 7,030-yard, par-72 TPC at Heron Bay on Thursday (players</p>
<p>U.S. unless stated):</p>
<p>67  Lee Janzen, Paul Stankowski</p>
<p>68  Colin Montgomerie (Britain), Billy Ray Brown, Greg Kraft,</p>
<p>    Payne Stewart, Stuart Appleby (Australia)</p>
<p>69  Doug Martin, Michael Bradley, Bruce Lietzke, John Huston,</p>
<p>    P.H. Horgan, Phil Blackmar, Guy Boros, Ronnie Black, Joe</p>
<p>    Durant, Rafael Alarcon (Mexico)</p>
<p>70  Tim Simpson, Tom Byrum, Bernhard Langer (Germany), Ian</p>
<p>    Woosnam (Britain), Mark McCumber, Andrew Magee, Chip Beck,</p>
<p>    Naomichi &quot;Joe&quot; Ozaki (Japan), Robert Gamez, Dick Mast</p>
<p>Non-U.S. scores</p>
<p>71  Jesper Parnevik (Sweden)</p>
<p>72  Ernie Els (South Africa), Vijay Singh (Fiji), Hideki Kase</p>
<p>    (Japan)</p>
<p>73  Wayne Grady (Australia), David Frost (South Africa)</p>
<p>74  Gabriel Hjerstedt (Sweden), Craig Parry (Australia)</p>
<p>75  Sandy Lyle (Britain)</p>
<p>81  Bradley Hughes (Australia)</p>
</text>
